  "invariants": [
    "The existing renderer-thread native invalidation worker handles native lists alongside native textareas. Read the actual native binding state and reuse echo_text_viewport and the original engine scroll setter.",
    "The real GNUstep list supplies selection reveal, row geometry, visible origin and full control pixels. Do not copy ScrollToOptionTask, a reveal algorithm, scroll geometry, control or renderer into the adapter.",
    "Keep exact independent native target assertions. Record immediate DOM reads and asynchronous samples; a retained original-adapter failure remains at 118 for eight seconds while native state already reports 223.",
    "Both pinned engines run the same list lifecycle test: trusted callback retirement, real native release, reinsertion, physical wheel, stable offset and complete independent native images.",
    "The shared native UI library remains API 1/584; Firefox is unchanged. Toolbar, address bar and tabs retain browser components, with optional future UI patches above the shared engine/toolkit layer."
  ]
